<title>GHANA: SOCCER-LIBERIA BEAT EGYPT 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LIBERIA BEAT EGYPT 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ACCRA 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberia beat Egypt 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in a World Cup African zone group two qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: George Weah 29</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
